  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 308.05 Hearing. Except as authorized by statute or these rules, a permittee to operate a pharmacy in New Hampshire shall not be disciplined except after notice and opportunity for hearing provided by Ph 200.\n\nSource. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05; ss by #8572, eff 2-23-06, EXPIRED: 2-23-14\n\nNew. #10702, INTERIM, eff 10-23-14, EXPIRED: 4-21-15\n\nNew. #11031, eff 1-29-16 (from Ph 308.04)",
